Public Domain source text

The Hebrew texts in this dataset use the following Sefaria versions.

- Avot DeRabbi Natan: Schechter edition, Recension A, Vienna, 1887.
- Sefer Yetzirah: Sefer Yetzirah, Warsaw 1884.

Both versions carry Sefaria's Public Domain source label. The edition and
chapter provenance is in source_editions.json.

Source policy: https://developers.sefaria.org/docs/usage-of-our-name-and-logo

HeOCR's own packaging and documentation are dedicated under CC0 1.0
Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
